WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.875
The same page, three style sheets.

2
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.515
A new style sheet changes only the look.

3
00:00:09.314 --> 00:00:12.264
The structure underneath never changed.

4
00:00:15.107 --> 00:00:18.982
Switch the style off, and the words and structure are still there.
